  "derivation": "Current 1.15.1 PE exact RTTI descriptors, self-RVA-checked COLs and vtable slots independently anchor parsers and scope/link types; current own-name atom/literal registrations anchor field tokens and define bridges. Current token dispatch and actual direct-call xrefs anchor members, wrappers and default/active callers. Historical byte windows assisted structural candidate nomination only; reviewed current graph determines coordinates and fresh PE bytes determine observations. No global address translation and no runtime execution.",
  "reviewed_chain": [
    "The independently located CTechnologyType RTTI parser subobject is +0x1a8; token0x53ce ai_weight dispatch subtracts0x140 to the numeric member+0x68. The constructor installs the numeric vtable at that member.",
    "The current AI function calls checked CCountry lookup and stores tag5 plus its ID in a scope tuple; the country wrapper RTTI vtable getter independently returns tag5.",
    "The observed technology candidate pointer is passed to eligibility and cost routines and its +0x70 expression is evaluated with three references to that country tuple. Cost-adjusted score is randomized and then compared with the current maximum; no terminal zero-score rejection is inferred.",
    "The exact NAI TECH_COST_PENALTY_FACTOR and TECH_RANDOM_FACTOR registrations bind the same globals read by the observed AI function."
  ],
